      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The sudden onset of extreme thirst and frequent urination alongside a new herbal supplement could indeed indicate dehydration or an adverse reaction, but it is a classic symptom of uncontrolled high blood sugar, which your type 2 diabetes requires immediate attention. GlucoFlow or any herbal remedy listed as a cure can contain unexpected active ingredients like chromium or pancreas extracts that interact unpredictably with diabetes medication, potentially causing a spike in glucose or severe dehydration. **You need to stop taking this product immediately and check your blood sugar right away**, as persistent symptoms like these can lead to dangerous complications like diabetic ketoacidosis if not addressed by a healthcare professional today.",
