    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait ok but if i check my sugar and it's not super high like, say, 180 or 200, can i just assume it's the supplement making me pee more? i dont really want to go to the doctor if it's just a side effect of the vitamins. do u think i can just drink more water and wait it out for a few days?",
