      "content": "idk i'm just really busy with work right now and a doctor visit is gonna take forever and cost a ton. if my sugar reading is okay, like if it stays at 210, is there anything i can take at home to just help with the thirst and the peeing so i don't have to go in yet? maybe just more electrolytes or something to balance it out?",
